AffineChartProj -- use an affine chart on the projective space
**************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        AffineChartProj => l

Description
===========

This is an optional input for some methods, and it works quite similar to *note
AffineChartGrass: AffineChartGrass,. The argument l can be an integer between 0
and $n$, corresponding to an affine chart $U$ on the projective space
$\mathbb{P}^n$. This indicates to the method that should perform internal
computations using the chart $U$.

