conormalVariety(...,Strategy=>...)
**********************************

Description
===========

This is an option for *note conormalVariety: conormalVariety, and *note
dualVariety: dualVariety, which specifies which algorithm to use. One can
choose between two strategies: "Saturate" and "Eliminate".

