|             4    3 5   2 4    1 5   2 3    1 4   2    0 5   1 2    0 4   1  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     x x )                                                                   |
|      0 3                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Ideal of QQ[x ..x ]                                                     |
|                  0   5                                                      |
