|                                                                             |
|            2                 2    2                                         |
|o2 = ideal(x x  - x x x  + x x  + x x  - 4x x x )                            |
|            2 3    1 2 4    0 4    1 5     0 3 5                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of QQ[x ..x ]                                                     |
|                  0   5                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : time V == dualVariety V'                                                |
| -- used 0.270925s (cpu); 0.212261s (thread); 0s (gc)                        |
